  m_text: 'Choose how you want to enter the theater.


    Audience Mode:

    Explore
    the hall and listen from different positions.

    Use 1, 2, 3, and 4 to change
    the listening style.


    Performer Mode:

    Spawn on stage and interact with
    the instrument.

    Press I to enter piano mode and play the keyboard.


    You
    can switch between modes anytime with O and P.

    Press K to show or hide the
    stage keyboard.'
